rue}},"body":"Today I cam across a weird bug where some chart types are not updating the dataset label colour when `this.$data._chart.update();` is called. Well, they are updating, but they are always one colour behind...\r\n\r\nThe following charts **show** this bug:\r\n\r\n- Bar\r\n- Horizontal Bar\r\n- Doughnut\r\n- Pie\r\n- Polar Area\r\n- Bubble\r\n\r\nThe following charts **do not show* this bug:\r\n- Line\r\n- Radar\r\n- Scatter\r\n\r\nGif below:\r\n\r\n![vuechartjs](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/40390596/72547667-f9711e00-3884-11ea-98ae-490f313ab900.gif)\r\n\r\n\r\n### Expected Behavior\r\n\r\n`this.$data._chart.update();` should update the dataset label for all charts.\r\n\r\n### Actual Behavior\r\n\r\nThe above chart types do not update the dataset label colour.\r\n\r\n### Workarounds\r\n\r\nCalling `this.renderChart(this.chartData,this.options)` instead of `this.$data._chart.update();` works.\r\nDouble calling `this.$data._chart.update();` also works!\r\n\r\nSeems to me like the label colour is being set after the `update()` method has done its thing for some charts.\r\n\r\n### Environment\r\n- vue.js version: 2.6.11\r\n- vue-chart.js version: 3.5.0\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apertureless/vue-chartjs/issues/592/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apertureless/vue-chartjs/issues/592/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":2955526991,"node_id":"MDE3OlJlbmFtZWRUaXRsZUV2ZW50Mjk1NTUyNjk5MQ==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chartjs/Chart.js/issues/events/2955526991","actor":null,"event":"renamed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2020-01-16T18:02:14Z","rename":{"from":".update() does not update the fieldset colour","to":".update() does not update the fieldset label colour"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":2955527566,"no